    "description": {
      "text": "\tThe facilities are surprisingly comfortable for what you might expect from a research station, a deliberate attempt to boost the productivity of the scientists that live and work here. Labs for all sorts of applied energistics, nuclear research, and even hyperspace experimentation form wings around the central habitation core, which is home to tens of thousands of scientists and engineers as well as a sizable support staff.",
      "toDisplay": null
    },
    "spaceport": {
      "text": "Ergastirio's spaceport is small, but well-equipped, with the facilities to handle special nuclear material and fragile scientific instrumentation alike. These constitute most of the goods offloaded here, which the station's laboratories require a steady supply of.",
      "toDisplay": null
