          {
            "key": "description",
            "values": [
              "When Consonance researchers' need for plentiful space and isolation outgrew what was available on Peripheria or Navigeo, dedicated as they were to habitation and shipbuilding respectively, this mid-sized station was built to accommodate a state-of-the-art collection of laboratory facilities. The work here is largely aimed towards weapons research, a necessary consequence of the fight against the Aberrant."
            ],
            "children": null
          },
          {
