      "text": "Hastily assembled from the parts of a mothballed interstellar laser driver, the Feo Platform is an enormous free electron laser intended to provide fire support to Avgi fleets defending the Tangled Shroud from Aberrant invasion. While a few Aberrations sometimes manage to slip past, the beam together with the fleetgroup the platform supports have so far managed to hold the line.",
